<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Information
related to ownership of common stock of the Company by certain persons is set forth under the caption &#8220;Security Ownership of
Certain Beneficial Owners and Management&#8221; in the Proxy Statement referred to in Item 10 above. Such information is incorporated
