Malaysia Ringgit ($<span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--ProfessionalFees_c20230912__20230912_zNlPVpS7Xvn7" title="Professional fees"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ProfessionalFees" contextRef="From2023-09-122023-09-12" id="Fact001132" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">1,065,235</ix:nonFraction></span>)
