During the year ended December 31, 2025, the Company accrued $<span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--InterestExpense_c20250101__20251231__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--ConvertiblePromissoryNotePurchaseAgreementMember_zspkBSucUOV2" title="Accumulated interest"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:InterestExpense" contextRef="From2025-01-012025-12-31_custom_ConvertiblePromissoryNotePurchaseAgreementMember" id="Fact001170" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">38,026</ix:nonFraction></span> as interest expense.</span></p>

