2024, the Company recorded rental amounts of $<span id="xdx_903_eus-gaap--PaymentsForRent_c20250101__20251231__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--DiamondBarMember_zf7ofOQTX4k9" title="Payments for rent"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PaymentsForRent" contextRef="From2025-01-012025-12-31_custom_DiamondBarMember" id="Fact001349" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">41,000</ix:nonFraction></span> and $<span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--PaymentsForRent_c20240101__20241231__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--DiamondBarMember_z1KVobx273X8" title="Payments for rent"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PaymentsForRent" contextRef="From2024-01-012024-12-31_custom_DiamondBarMember" id="Fact001351" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">39,390</ix:nonFraction></span>, respectively, which were included in selling expenses.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

