effective on February 1, 2023 for <span id="xdx_902_ecustom--ConsultingAgreementTerm_dc_c20230128__20230128__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--AdvisoryServiceAgreementMember_zLkipyWqnDLj" title="Consulting agreement term"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2023-01-282023-01-28_custom_AdvisoryServiceAgreementMember" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" id="Fact001595" name="XWIN:ConsultingAgreementTerm">twelve months</ix:nonNumeric></span>. The Company shall pay the designer $<span id="xdx_906_ecustom--PaymentsForDesigner_c20230128__20230128__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--AdvisoryServiceAgreementMember_z9t211nNkHli" title="Payments for designer"><ix:nonFraction name="XWIN:PaymentsForDesigner" contextRef="From2023-01-282023-01-28_custom_AdvisoryServiceAgreementMember" id="Fact001597" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">10,000</ix:nonFraction></span></span>
