an aggregate of <span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross_c20190812__20190812__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefFinancialOfficerMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandFourteenOmnibusEquityPlanMember_zCF9uIZbKaa3" title="Options granted to purchase common stock"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross" contextRef="From2019-08-122019-08-12_srt_ChiefFinancialOfficerMember_custom_TwoThousandFourteenOmnibusEquityPlanMember" id="Fact001854" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">1,400</ix:nonFraction></span> shares of the Company&#8217;s common stock at an exercise price of $<span id="xdx_905_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementsByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageExercisePrice_c20190812__20190812__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefFinancialOfficerMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandFourteenOmnibusEquityPlanMember_zhOhoRfCJWBb" title="Weighted average exercise price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementsByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageExercisePrice" contextRef="From2019-08-122019-08-12_srt_ChiefFinancialOfficerMember_custom_TwoThousandFourteenOmnibusEquityPlanMember" id="Fact001856" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">19.25</ix:nonFraction></span> per share, with a term of <span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardExpirationPeriod_dtY_c20190812__20190812__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefFinancialOfficerMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandFourteenOmnibusEquityPlanMember_z4Yxgo722qW8" title="Option term"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2019-08-122019-08-12_srt_ChiefFinancialOfficerMember_custom_TwoThousandFourteenOmnibusEquityPlanMember" format="ixt-sec:duryear" id="Fact001858" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardExpirationPeriod">5</ix:nonNumeric></span> years, pursuant
to the Company&#8217;s 2014 Omnibus Long-Term Incentive Plan. Fifty percent (<span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage_pid_dp_uPure_c20190812__20190812__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefFinancialOfficerMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandFourteenOmnibusEquityPlanMember_zl7hzQz5S7L9" title="Stock options vested"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage" contextRef="From2019-08-122019-08-12_srt_ChiefFinancialOfficerMember_custom_TwoThousandFourteenOmnibusEquityPlanMember" id="Fact001860" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">50</ix:nonFraction></span>%) of those stock options vested immediately, and the
remaining <span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage_pid_dp_uPure_c20190812__20190812__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefFinancialOfficerMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SixMonthAnniversaryMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandFourteenOmnibusEquityPlanMember_zwcXikaKrmR9" title="Options vesting percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage" contextRef="From2019-08-122019-08-12_srt_ChiefFinancialOfficerMember_custom_SixMonthAnniversaryMember_custom_TwoThousandFourteenOmnibusEquityPlanMember" id="Fact001862" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">50</ix:nonFraction></span>% vested on the six-month anniversary of the grant date.</span></p>

