<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
fair value of the option granted to the Chief Financial Officer in 2019 was recognized as compensation expense over the vesting period
of the stock option award. The fair value of the option was calculated using Black-Scholes model under the following assumptions: estimated
life of <span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsExpectedTerm1_dc_c20190812__20190812__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefFinancialOfficerMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandFourteenOmnibusEquityPlanMember_zLElQMcZRvQ9" title="Estimated life"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2019-08-122019-08-12_srt_ChiefFinancialOfficerMember_custom_TwoThousandFourteenOmnibusEquityPlanMember" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" id="Fact001864" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsExpectedTerm1">five years</ix:nonNumeric></span>, volatility of <span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsExpectedVolatilityRate_pid_dp_uPure_c20190812__20190812__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefFinancialOfficerMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandFourteenOmnibusEquityPlanMember_zKbmjewrBaKc" title="Volatility rate"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsExpectedVolatilityRate" contextRef="From2019-08-122019-08-12_srt_ChiefFinancialOfficerMember_custom_TwoThousandFourteenOmnibusEquityPlanMember" id="Fact001866" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">87</ix:nonFraction></span>%, risk free interest rate of <span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsRiskFreeInterestRate_pid_dp_uPure_c20190812__20190812__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefFinancialOfficerMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandFourteenOmnibusEquityPlanMember_zM44ZNCVDEEl" title="Risk free interest rate"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsRiskFreeInterestRate" contextRef="From2019-08-122019-08-12_srt_ChiefFinancialOfficerMember_custom_TwoThousandFourteenOmnibusEquityPlanMember" id="Fact001868" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">1.49</ix:nonFraction></span>%, and dividend yield of <span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsExpectedDividendRate_pid_dp_uPure_c20190812__20190812__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefFinancialOfficerMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandFourteenOmnibusEquityPlanMember_zqr6AcEw5xI9" title="Dividend yield"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsExpectedDividendRate" contextRef="From2019-08-122019-08-12_srt_ChiefFinancialOfficerMember_custom_TwoThousandFourteenOmnibusEquityPlanMember" id="Fact001870" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">0</ix:nonFraction></span>%. The fair value of the <span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross_c20190812__20190812__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefFinancialOfficerMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandFourteenOmnibusEquityPlanMember_zjaduiDdIEyb" title="Options granted to purchase common stock"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross" contextRef="From2019-08-122019-08-12_srt_ChiefFinancialOfficerMember_custom_TwoThousandFourteenOmnibusEquityPlanMember" id="Fact001872" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">1,400</ix:nonFraction></span> stock
options was $<span id="xdx_90A_ecustom--FairValueOfStockOptions_c20190812__20190812__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefFinancialOfficerMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandFourteenOmnibusEquityPlanMember_zu9W0cKW4pCc" title="Fair value of stock options"><ix:nonFraction name="XWIN:FairValueOfStockOptions" contextRef="From2019-08-122019-08-12_srt_ChiefFinancialOfficerMember_custom_TwoThousandFourteenOmnibusEquityPlanMember" id="Fact001874" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">18,318</ix:nonFraction></span> at the grant date.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

